<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA BEAT SOUTH AFRICA BY SEVEN WICKETS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA BEAT SOUTH AFRICA BY SEVEN WICKETS.</headline>
<dateline>PORT ELIZABETH, South Africa 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia beat South Africa by seven wickets in the second one-day internationals at St George's Park on Monday.</p>
<p>Scores: South Africa 221-8 in 50 overs, Australia 222-3 in 45 overs.</p>
</text>
